{"id":"c284ffb568a496fd","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-finite-automaton-language-class.md","title":"Regular Language","display":"df-regular-language — Regular Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","aliases":["73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","73-df-regular-language"],"display":"df-regular-language — Regular Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</span><span>73-df-regular-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-language — Regular Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (DFA class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> (language accepted by a DFA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是此语言域上的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(M))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(M))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>DFA recognition is the defining clause. Equivalence with NFA, epsilon-NFA, and regular-expression presentations is theorem content rather than circularly built into this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L(M)$ (language accepted by a DFA, see [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(M))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1113,"backlinks":[{"id":"01b7b9d9615ddaa5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。"},{"id":"d98c56ef00c67ca3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular language, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])"},{"id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fa5a4ce6b6982a00","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular languages, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])"},{"id":"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular languages, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])"}],"outgoing":["3b7a967565c86f39"]}